cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or research audit, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Meru Geometry Audit"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gherbi"
    given-names: "Salah-Eddin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-4017-1095"
version: 0.8.0
date-released: 2026-08-04
abstract: >-
  A reproducible mathematical audit of Stan Tenen's Meru Foundation geometry,
  including reciprocal-spiral, toroidal, tetrahedral, combinatorial, and
  alphabet-projection claims. Version 0.8.0 adds preregistered FIRST HAND
  endpoint-parallelism tests, truncation and comparator analyses, a bounded
  dimpled-sphere carrier-family sweep, and a source-recovery audit of the
  published FIRST HAND construction record.
keywords:
  - geometry
  - computational geometry
  - tetrahedron
  - torus
  - torus knot
  - reciprocal spiral
  - Hebrew alphabet
  - Meru Foundation
license: MIT
